# The animation scene, which F7 in mygame cycles to: two of the Khronos Fox, skinned, on a white floor in the sun. The
# near one plays fox.animation_graph, which its fox_walker behaviour sets the speed of and moves it by, and whose
# footsteps it logs (see docs/animation/design.md#the-ecs); the far one runs, with an Animator that plays the run clip
# alone. They face +x, so the camera sees them from the side. Positions are raw World_Position values in units of
# 2^-24 m. The editor writes this file; see docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
